              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "وقت گذراندن (vaqt gozarândan) — \"to spend time\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "او با نوه هایش وقت میگذراند. u bâ navehâyash vaqt migozarânad. She spends time with her grandchildren."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "vaqt 'time' + gozarândan 'to pass (something)'; present stem gozarân-."
            }
          ]
        },
